+# Task contract — round names for K League 1's split rounds and the Coupe de France's 2026 rounds
+
+objective: >
+  The latest season of K League 1 (Championship Group - N, Relegation Group - N) and of the Coupe de
+  France (1/128-finals, Round of 128) has a name for every round, so the competition page's meta line
+  and Matchdays picker show a name on both and `mart_competition_index` carries a current round for
+  KL1 and CDF. Four rows are added to `dbt_project/seeds/round_names.csv`, each following the row it
+  mirrors: the two K League 1 rows reuse Veikkausliiga's split-season keys and texts, the two Coupe de
+  France 2026 rows repeat the 2025 season's rows (Seventh round, Eighth round), which the fixtures'
+  dates match: 92 ties on 31 Oct to 15 Nov and 46 ties on 27 to 29 Nov, as in 2025.
+refs: "#148"
+
+scope_paths:
+  - dbt_project/seeds/round_names.csv
+  - .claude/task/148-kl1-cdf-round-names/contract.md
+  - .claude/task/148-kl1-cdf-round-names/review.md
+  - .claude/task/148-kl1-cdf-round-names/review_input.patch
+
+depends_on:
+  - none: the change stands alone; the copy keys it uses already exist in site_v2/src/i18n/strings.ts in EN, DE and FI
+shared_files:
+  - none: no design baseline, chart manifest or chart pin changes
+
+decisions_taken: >
+  The coordinating session's message of 2026-11-22 rules the work: add the K League 1 and Coupe de
+  France rows, names following the existing rows' pattern, pre-go-live fan wording being the
+  coordinator's call. It also covers the two sibling rounds that stand in the same latest-season gap
+  (KL1 Championship Group, CDF 1/128-finals), which the stored failures of
+  assert_every_round_text_resolves list with the two named. No new key, no new text, no cost.
+
+decisions_reserved:
+  - "none: every name reuses a text already in strings.ts; the Play-In Final of the Chilean cup CNL, also unnamed, is left as it is"
+
+approved_design:
+  - none: no page layout changes; the competition page's meta line and Matchdays picker already render a served round name
+
+done_when:
+  - "`.venv/Scripts/dbt.exe parse --project-dir dbt_project` passes."
+  - "`python scripts/check_copy_gate.py` passes: every key of the new rows exists in EN, DE and FI."
+  - "In the merge request's data build, `assert_every_round_text_resolves` reports no KL1 or CDF row, and `mart_competition_index` has a `current_round_label_i18n_key` for KL1 and CDF."
+
+amendments: (none)
